00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:07,000
Welcome to the Fifth Generation—the frontier of Artificial Intelligence and Quantum Computing.

2
00:00:06,950 --> 00:00:16,375
Machines are no longer merely executing rigid instructions; they learn, infer, reason, and create alongside humanity.

3
